## Server / Client Boundary Rules

- Default to Server Components.
- Only use `"use client"` when interactivity is required.
- Never pass non-serializable values to Client Components.
- Keep server-only logic out of client bundles.
- Avoid unnecessary client state duplication of server data.
- Keep sensitive logic and secrets server-side.

