- Use **Server Components** for initial data fetching whenever possible.
- Avoid client-side fetching unless interactivity requires it.
- Deduplicate fetches through shared data utilities.
- Validate all external inputs.
- Use optimistic updates carefully with rollback handling.
- Keep mutations server-side (Server Actions or API routes).

